{"slug":"linux-privilege-escalation-checklist","title":"Linux Privilege Escalation Checklist","date":"2026-09-22","updated":null,"description":"A short, ordered checklist for local privilege escalation enumeration on Linux lab machines: sudo, SUID binaries, cron, capabilities and writable paths.","category":"notes","platform":null,"difficulty":null,"tags":["linux","privilege-escalation","checklist"],"featured":false,"cover":null,"readingTime":1,"html":"<p>An ordered list of quick checks to run on a Linux box after getting a shell. Start cheap and local before reaching for automated tools.</p>\n<h2 id=\"identity-and-sudo\">Identity and sudo<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#identity-and-sudo\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">sudo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -l</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Any <code>NOPASSWD</code> entry deserves a look at <a href=\"https://gtfobins.github.io/\">GTFOBins</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"suid-binaries-and-capabilities\">SUID binaries and capabilities<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#suid-binaries-and-capabilities\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">find</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -perm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -4000</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -type</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> 2></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/dev/null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">getcap</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> 2></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/dev/null</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"scheduled-tasks\">Scheduled tasks<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#scheduled-tasks\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">cat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /etc/crontab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">ls</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -la</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /etc/cron.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">*</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Look for scripts that run as root but are writable by your user.</p>\n<h2 id=\"writable-paths-and-credentials\">Writable paths and credentials<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#writable-paths-and-credentials\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">find</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -writable</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -type</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> 2></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/dev/null</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> '^/(proc|sys|dev|run)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">grep</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -ril</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"password\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /var/www</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /opt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> /home</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> 2></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/dev/null</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout-tip\" role=\"note\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Tip</p>\n<p>Note what you checked and the result. Negative results are just as useful when you come back later.</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"quick-reference\">Quick reference<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#quick-reference\">#</a></h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Command</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kernel</td><td><code>uname -a</code></td></tr><tr><td>Listening</td><td><code>ss -tulpn</code></td></tr><tr><td>Processes</td><td><code>ps aux</code></td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td><code>env</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>","toc":[{"depth":2,"id":"identity-and-sudo","text":"Identity and sudo"},{"depth":2,"id":"suid-binaries-and-capabilities","text":"SUID binaries and capabilities"},{"depth":2,"id":"scheduled-tasks","text":"Scheduled tasks"},{"depth":2,"id":"writable-paths-and-credentials","text":"Writable paths and credentials"},{"depth":2,"id":"quick-reference","text":"Quick reference"}],"prev":{"slug":"sample-recon-helper","title":"Sample Project: A Small Recon Notes Helper"},"next":{"slug":"offsec-lab-methodology-notes","title":"Sample OffSec Notes: A Repeatable Enumeration Methodology"},"related":["htb-sample-lantern"]}